Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交到朋友了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:54.20,0:01:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 交了很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.10,0:02:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 我幫你包餃子吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.50,0:02:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 你會嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.00,0:02:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.70,0:02:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.30,0:02:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}午後的窗口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 怎麼了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在發呆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.90,0:03:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得抓緊了 爸爸快回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.90,0:03:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.80,0:03:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是戶高女士送來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她要我傳個話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.60,0:03:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說出去的話會遭殃的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.70,0:04:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛還真是喜歡櫻桃啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.40,0:04:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼倒掉了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 快點做你的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.50,0:04:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 安田太太 早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.10,0:04:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,櫻桃你喫了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多謝您的款待
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.80,0:04:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.00,0:05:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在問你味道怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.70,0:05:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 非常美味
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.30,0:05:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.30,0:05:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,清除餃子的餘味大概正好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.70,0:05:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼會知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.30,0:05:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你家昨晚有些味道呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.50,0:05:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心點可不行啊 安田太太
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.30,0:05:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在用大蒜的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.70,0:05:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏和鄉下獨門獨戶可不一樣呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.20,0:05:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某種程度上可以說是共同生活呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 你們兩個也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就說到這裏吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.30,0:05:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安田太太纔剛剛從鄉下出來呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安田太太 似乎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.50,0:05:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您家的女兒被編到我家女兒那個班了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.50,0:05:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 我走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心點兒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.60,0:06:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們之間如果也能和睦相處就好了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.70,0:06:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安田太太 得小心點啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.80,0:06:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這裏要是得罪了戶高太太
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.70,0:06:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到最後連你老公和女兒都會受牽連的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.00,0:06:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎麼說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.00,0:06:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可是獨攬大權的分公司經理夫人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.00,0:06:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,覺不覺得有股臭味
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.70,0:06:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是餃子的氣味啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.80,0:07:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,餃子 這不是很糟糕嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是超糟糕吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.30,0:07:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做過什麼讓高戶家的由理亞不開心的事情了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.80,0:07:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她們說我有餃子味 很看不起我 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 快開門啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.80,0:07:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是爸爸啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.70,0:08:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.70,0:08:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了啊 這麼不順心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.60,0:08:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天知道 突然被分公司經理叫出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.60,0:08:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然被大罵了一頓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.70,0:08:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做了什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.60,0:08:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不會是惹惱了他太太吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.60,0:08:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這算是什麼話 明明是她不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.80,0:08:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 你不會真的做了什麼吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.70,0:08:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饒了我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.50,0:08:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着啊 我什麼都沒做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.60,0:08:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.40,0:08:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託你了 不要引起糾紛啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.90,0:08:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果跟那個分公司經理沒有相處好就糟了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 朋友要來找我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.80,0:08:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 他可是很厲害的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.90,0:08:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厲害是指…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你應該明白的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.50,0:08:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也好好期待吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 現在就上門來打擾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是裝不在家的話 可饒不了你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.00,0:09:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.80,0:09:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太太 你在家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快開門啊 太太
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.00,0:09:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你把我叫來的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.60,0:09:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呦 快讓我進去 喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 快開門啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.50,0:09:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.70,0:09:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會被別人聽到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.70,0:09:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 聽到沒有啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.80,0:09:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 請住手 求求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.90,0:09:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 開門
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.00,0:10:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 現在不是悠閒漫步的時候吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.20,0:10:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你家好像出了什麼事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.30,0:10:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有個年輕的男人闖了進去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.40,0:10:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不得了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.50,0:10:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說你媽媽有外遇了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.70,0:10:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是糟透了啊 親人有外遇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要說了啊 你們兩個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.60,0:10:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安田太太 可憐啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.00,0:10:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.00,0:11:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽 振作點啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.90,0:11:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼 爲什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.00,0:11:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了 住在這裏要是惹惱了那個人就算了完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.90,0:11:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我會這麼倒黴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.70,0:11:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是戶高太太她自己不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.50,0:11:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戶高太太？ 到底發生了什麼事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.60,0:12:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生日快樂啊 由理亞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝啊 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 真不錯啊 給我的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的生日還沒到吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.50,0:12:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別這麼早就讓自己老一歲嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.90,0:12:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 真沒禮貌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.00,0:12:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他們 是他們的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.90,0:12:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要驚訝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.40,0:12:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼喚我的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.80,0:12:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 你就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.60,0:12:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.90,0:13:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.00,0:13:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戶高太太和我媽媽之間到底發生了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了又怎樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得知真相後我要報復
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.60,0:13:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然的話 媽媽她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.60,0:13:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲我不要看到媽媽難過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.30,0:13:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我無法幫助你的媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.50,0:13:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能做到的就只有復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,復仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.60,0:13:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.50,0:13:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:45.20,0:13:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.90,0:13:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.00,0:13:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.00,0:13:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.40,0:14:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.60,0:14:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.30,0:14:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死之後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.40,0:14:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.60,0:14:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣你還要消除怨恨嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.90,0:14:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 就讓你看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.80,0:14:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.00,0:15:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯 是一切開始的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.90,0:15:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看 過來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.00,0:15:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.80,0:15:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是那個時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.80,0:15:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍得相當不錯呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.00,0:15:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不想這些被散佈出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事就別到處說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.30,0:15:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要是多嘴的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.20,0:16:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 接下來就輪到你女兒遭殃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.00,0:16:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 真的假的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.20,0:16:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下 求求你了 快停下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.00,0:16:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的母親真不走運\N無意中看到了不該看到的東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.60,0:16:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別說什麼不走運
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.80,0:16:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不對的明明是由理亞的媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.20,0:16:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可爲什麼一定要欺負我媽媽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.40,0:16:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我無法接受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.80,0:16:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呢 不過 所以我纔會在這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.50,0:16:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽回來了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你給我做了什麼好事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.50,0:16:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒有立足之地了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 公司裏也都在流傳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.50,0:17:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在外面勾引年輕男人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.60,0:17:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.90,0:17:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這全是戶高太太她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴 不要再說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼不能相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.10,0:17:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 根本連聽都不聽我說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.20,0:17:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直 一直你只顧着自己的工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.70,0:17:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以爲你是靠誰才過上現在這種日子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的家已經一團糟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.50,0:17:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.00,0:17:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個女人的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.40,0:17:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:18.50,0:18:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了 是誰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是送來給您的東西 太太
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:25.60,0:18:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.90,0:19:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老公
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:12.30,0:19:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的 誤會啊誤會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是被這個男人強迫的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要撒謊了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你勾引那個男人的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我啊 我纔是受害者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這個噁心的傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.60,0:19:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是這個男人強迫我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈美子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.40,0:20:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們是誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.40,0:20:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.90,0:20:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要做這種事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.60,0:20:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在學校被欺負了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.30,0:20:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.30,0:20:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞外遇的原來是戶高太太啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這隻發情的母狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下子丟臉丟大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.60,0:20:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 雖然有點年紀了但身材不錯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們到底是誰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.90,0:20:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們都給我消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這小鬼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:55.00,0:20:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.20,0:21:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.50,0:21:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:05.00,0:21:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.20,0:21:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎來到悲歡哀樂的慾望盡頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:29.00,0:21:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸 但這裏很適合你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.30,0:21:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.90,0:21:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.40,0:21:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天我做的事情究竟是不是好事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.70,0:21:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己也不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.00,0:22:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早…早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:02.70,0:22:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 早上好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:04.10,0:22:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是讓人受不了啊 你媽媽的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:06.20,0:22:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然和男人私奔了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:08.80,0:22:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當分公司經理太太也不容易啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要說了啊 小孩子是無罪的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.40,0:22:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽也恢復了往日笑容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:21.50,0:22:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要她能這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.80,0:22:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我現在也能算是幸福的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:27.90,0:22:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能一生都這麼幸福下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.20,0:22:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 總有一天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.50,0:22:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對 我結束一生的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.00,0:22:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會因爲那天那時我所做的事得到報應
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:45.60,0:22:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每當看到胸口的這個刻印
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:50.90,0:22:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便會想起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.00,0:23:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.70,0:23:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.20,0:23:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.10,0:23:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ {\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ {\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:46.20,0:23:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:50.00,0:24:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.00,0:24:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:08.00,0:24:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.40,0:24:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.50,0:24:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紅 彩花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.70,0:24:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲何如此怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.50,0:24:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個人一點都不愛我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.60,0:24:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不僅如此 還想將我的未來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.50,0:24:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我成爲女演員的未來給毀了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.60,0:24:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:50.70,0:24:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那傢伙流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.50,0:25:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.50,0:25:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}龜裂的面具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:03.50,0:25:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(600,600)}地獄少女project/SK Per Wellthink ANIPLEX
